OL,3,GNEWSAWork to restore landmark Chinatown
OL,4,Aarchway under way
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork has started on the restoration of
OL,7,Fa landmark archway in Manchester's
OL,8,FChinatown.
OL,10,FThe Grade II-listed feature was a gift
OL,11,Ffrom Beijing to the people of the city
OL,12,Fin the mid 1980s.
OL,14,FThe gateway into the city's Chinatown
OL,15,Fis now in need of significant repairs
OL,16,Fwhich is estimated to take two years to
OL,17,Fcomplete, Manchester City Council said.
OL,19,FCouncillor Mandie Shilton Godwin said
OL,20,Fwhile the arch will be missed during
OL,21,Fthe work "rest assured it will be worth
OL,22,Fthe wait".
